.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ngx-cert 1  "ngx-cert " 
.SH NAME
ngx\-cert \- Certificates: info, issue, renew, auto\-renewal on/off (wraps certbot)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBngx\-cert\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Certificates: info, issue, renew, auto\-renewal on/off (wraps certbot)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ngx\-cert\-info(1)
Show certificate details: expiry, issuer, covered names, renewal
.TP
ngx\-cert\-issue(1)
Obtain a Let\*(Aqs Encrypt certificate for a site and switch it to HTTPS
.TP
ngx\-cert\-renew(1)
Renew a site\*(Aqs certificate now and reload nginx
.TP
ngx\-cert\-auto(1)
Turn automatic renewal on or off (sets `autorenew` in the certbot renewal config)
.TP
ngx\-cert\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
